                <p>
                    <lb n="1"/><hi rend="grantha">śrī</hi>-pāṇṭiyaṉ talai <add place="below">koṇṭa</add> kō-<supplied reason="omitted">p</supplied>-parakē<hi rend="grantha">sa</hi>ri-pa<hi rend="grantha"><unclear>nma</unclear></hi><reg>r</reg>kki yāṇṭu 5-Ā<supplied reason="omitted">va</supplied>tu
                </p>                
                
                <p>
                    <lb n="2"/><hi rend="grantha">śrī</hi>-m<choice><orig>u</orig><reg>ū</reg></choice>la<hi rend="grantha">s<choice><orig>t</orig><reg>th</reg></choice>ā</hi>ṉam-uṭ<unclear>ai</unclear>yār<supplied reason="omitted">k</supplied>ku-p peruṅkoṉṟai tēvappai-paṭṭar
                    <lb n="3"/>makaṉ nampi tāmōtiraṉ vaitta nun=tā-viḷakk' oṉṟu
                </p>
                <p>
                    Itu
                    <lb n="4"/>ca<hi rend="grantha">n<choice><orig>t</orig><reg>d</reg></choice>rā</hi>tittaval
                </p>
