            <div type="translation" source="bib:Kuppusamy+al2010_01">
                <p n="1">5th year <supplied reason="subaudible">of the reign</supplied> of the king Parakēsaripanmar, who took the head of
Vīrapāṇṭiyaṉ</p>
                <p n="2-3">The perpetual lamp endowed by Nampi Tāmōtiraṉ, son of Tēvappai-paṭṭar of Peruṅ-koṉṟai <supplied reason="explanation">a village</supplied>, is one.</p>
                <p n="3-4">This is to last till the moon and the sun will last.</p>
            </div>
            
